# A11y + SEO

- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` disables Lenis easing and GSAP/WebGL; show the resting composition.
- Keyboard: skip link, logical heading order, focusable controls, no scroll-hijack traps.
- `button` for actions, `Link`/`a` for navigation. Icon buttons need `aria-label`.
- Images: real `alt`. Decorative: `alt=""`.
- Never `user-scalable=no` or `maximum-scale=1`.
- Metadata: unique title template, description, canonical, OG image, Twitter card, `json-ld` Person + CreativeWork.
- Semantic sections with ids for in-page nav; `scroll-margin-top` on anchors.
- Contrast AA on text. `:focus-visible` rings. `aria-live` for async toasts.